<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Contact.FirstName},</font><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thanks for your job inquiry, but at this time it appears that you need more experience in your specialty.</font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif">All of our positions require a minimum of 2 years of recent paid experience in the specialty to which you applied.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif">I would like to serve as a resource to you, so please feel free to contact me with any questions you have, and I look forward to working with you as you gain the necessary experience.</font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Again, thank for inquiring and best of luck!</font></div><div><br></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!User.FirstName}&nbsp;{!User.LastName}</font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!User.Email}</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
